I still knew he was never going to win as much as everyone else.
"In my first interview in 2005, I already noticed that they were watching me cautiously.
Because of my training and my professional and personal progress," Kerviel told the researchers.
But shortly after my entry into the company came the first great success.
Thanks to Allianz's actions he won, during the bomb attacks in London, kicking down a 500 million-euro title.
