A colleague passes information on the introduction in the Criminal Code of offences of Internet download offences:
A. Unloading a song would be an offence with a penalty of six months to a year.
On the other hand, if you steal disks worth less than 400 euros from the store, it is considered simply missing (article 623.1).
B. If you steal from the store up to 1,000 euros, the theft is already a crime, but the penalty is still lower than that imposed on the discharge (article 234 of the Criminal Code).
C. If you steal a car and give it back 40 hours later, the penalty is still lower than that of undisbursing (art. 244.1).
D. It is less serious to participate in a fight than to participate in the compact exchange.
Participating in a tumultuous quarrel carries a penalty of three months to one year (article 154 of the Criminal Code) and the exchange would have a sentence of six months to two years
