E. Se sexual harassment at work is considered less serious than downloading a DVD film, according to section 184.2 of the Criminal Code.
F. The distribution of copyright-protected and unlicensed films of the authors is more punished than the distribution of pornographic material to minors (art. 186).
Either way, if my colleague is right, somebody's getting their hand, a very long hand.
