Fifteen, whose films include Scum, Nil By Mouth and Sexy Beast, is currently filming Indiana Jones' sequel "The Reign of the Glass Skull."
Winstone said he was proud to receive the award, named after Camelot and Harry Potter star Harris, who died in 2002.
